   - **Functionaling with functional groups (e.g., carboxyl groups, carboxylated GO):** Functionalization improves the dispersion of GO in PE, improving the mechanical properties. The functional groups can form stronger interactions with the polymer matrix, improving interfacial adhesion and improving mechanical properties.

