- \( \sigma \): The cross section for plason emission.
- \( m_e \): The electron mass.
- \( E_0 \): The energy of the incident electron.
- \( E_F \): The Fermi energy of the material.
- \( E_p = \hbar \omega_p \): The plason energy, where \( \omega_p \) is the plason frequency.

