     - \( \dot{m} \) is the mass flow rate of the air.  
     - \( c_p \) is the specific heat of air at constant pressure.  
     - \( T_s \) is the surface temperature of the plate.  
     - \( T_\infty \) is the free-stream temperature of the air.  

