   \]
   where \( m_{\text{gas}} \) is the mass of the gases, \( c_{\text{gas}} = 1.005 \, \text{kJ/kgK} \) is the specific heat of the gases, and \( \Delta T = 1100 - 550 = 550 \, \text{K} \) is the temperature change of the gases.

2. **Relate the heat lost by the gases to the heat gained by the water**:
