   \[
   m_{\text{cannonball}} v_{\text{cannonball}} + m_{\text{Earth}} v_{\text{Earth}} = 0
   \]

3. **Solving for \( v_{\text{Earth}} \)**:  
   Rearranging the equation to solve for \( v_{\text{Earth}} \):  
   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} = -\frac{m_{\text{cannonball}} v_{\text{cannonball}}}{m_{\text{Earth}}}
   \]  
